<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Campus Connect — Your People. Your Interests. Your Campus.</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Campus Connect helps college students find friends, discover shared interests, join communities, ask academic questions, and participate in campus activities.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <style>
    /* ==========================================================================
       1. CSS VARIABLES & THEME SETUP
       ========================================================================== */
    :root {
      --navy-950: #070d18;
      --navy-900: #0b1329;
      --navy-850: #101c3d;
      --navy-800: #16244f;
      --navy-700: #1f326b;
      --navy-600: #29428b;
      
      --indigo-600: #4f46e5;
      --indigo-500: #6366f1;
      --indigo-400: #818cf8;
      --indigo-100: #e0e7ff;
      --indigo-50: #eef2ff;

      --violet-600: #7c3aed;
      --violet-500: #8b5cf6;
      --violet-400: #a78bfa;
      --violet-100: #ede9fe;
      --violet-50: #f5f3ff;

      --emerald-500: #10b981;
      --emerald-100: #d1fae5;
      --emerald-50: #ecfdf5;

      --amber-500: #f59e0b;
      --amber-100: #fef3c7;
      
      --rose-500: #f43f5e;
      --rose-100: #ffe4e6;

      --slate-900: #0f172a;
      --slate-800: #1e293b;
      --slate-700: #334155;
      --slate-600: #475569;
      --slate-500: #64748b;
      --slate-400: #94a3b8;
      --slate-300: #cbd5e1;
      --slate-200: #e2e8f0;
      --slate-100: #f1f5f9;
      --slate-50: #f8fafc;
      --white: #ffffff;

      --font-sans: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      --font-display: 'Space Grotesk', 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;

      --radius-sm: 8px;
      --radius-md: 12px;
      --radius-lg: 16px;
      --radius-xl: 24px;
      --radius-full: 9999px;

      --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(11, 19, 41, 0.05);
      --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(11, 19, 41, 0.08), 0 2px 4px -2px rgba(11, 19, 41, 0.05);
      --shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(11, 19, 41, 0.09), 0 4px 6px -4px rgba(11, 19, 41, 0.04);
      --shadow-xl: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(11, 19, 41, 0.12), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(11, 19, 41, 0.06);
      --shadow-indigo: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.35);

      --transition-fast: 150ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      --transition-normal: 250ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      --transition-spring: 400ms cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       2. RESET & BASE STYLES
       ========================================================================== */
    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      font-size: 16px;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      background-color: var(--slate-50);
      color: var(--slate-800);
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    button {
      font-family: inherit;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
      background: none;
      outline: none;
      transition: all var(--transition-fast);
    }

    button:focus-visible,
    input:focus-visible,
    select:focus-visible,
    textarea:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--indigo-500);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    input, select, textarea {
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    ul, ol {
      list-style: none;
    }

    img, svg {
      vertical-align: middle;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    /* Container Utility */
    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1240px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      padding-right: 1.5rem;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       3. NAVIGATION BAR
       ========================================================================== */
    .site-header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 50;
      background: rgba(11, 19, 41, 0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .header-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      height: 72px;
    }

    .brand-logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .brand-icon-wrapper {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--indigo-500), var(--violet-500));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
    }

    .nav-menu {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .nav-link {
      padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--slate-300);
      transition: all var(--transition-fast);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .nav-link:hover {
      color: var(--white);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .nav-link.active {
      color: var(--white);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.6), rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.6));
      border: 1px solid rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.3);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .header-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .btn-profile-badge {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      padding: 0.3rem 0.85rem 0.3rem 0.35rem;
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: all var(--transition-fast);
    }

    .btn-profile-badge:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .avatar-sm {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ec4899, #8b5cf6);
      color: var(--white);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .mobile-nav-toggle {
      display: none;
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      color: var(--white);
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    /* Mobile Drawer */
    .mobile-drawer {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(7, 13, 24, 0.7);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity var(--transition-normal);
    }

    .mobile-drawer.open {
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .mobile-drawer-content {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 300px;
      background: var(--navy-900);
      border-left: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      transform: translateX(100%);
      transition: transform var(--transition-normal);
      box-shadow: -10px 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }

    .mobile-drawer.open .mobile-drawer-content {
      transform: translateX(0);
    }

    .drawer-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      padding-bottom: 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .drawer-nav-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .drawer-nav-list .nav-link {
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       4. BUTTONS & UI CONTROLS
       ========================================================================== */
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.925rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.65rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      transition: all var(--transition-normal);
      cursor: pointer;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--indigo-600), var(--violet-600));
      color: var(--white);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.35);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4338ca, #6d28d9);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.45);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      color: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--indigo-600);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--indigo-600);
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
      background: var(--indigo-50);
      color: var(--indigo-700);
    }

    .btn-white {
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--navy-900);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }

    .btn-white:hover {
      background: var(--slate-100);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-sm {
      padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
      font-size: 0.825rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    }

    .btn-joined {
      background: var(--emerald-50) !important;
      color: var(--emerald-500) !important;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--emerald-500) !important;
    }

    .btn-joined:hover {
      background: #fee2e2 !important;
      color: var(--rose-500) !important;
      border-color: var(--rose-500) !important;
    }

    /* Badges */
    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.3rem;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .badge-indigo { background: var(--indigo-100); color: var(--indigo-600); }
    .badge-violet { background: var(--violet-100); color: var(--violet-600); }
    .badge-emerald { background: var(--emerald-100); color: #047857; }
    .badge-amber { background: var(--amber-100); color: #b45309; }
    .badge-rose { background: var(--rose-100); color: #be123c; }
    .badge-slate { background: var(--slate-200); color: var(--slate-700); }

    /* ==========================================================================
       5. MAIN APP VIEW CONTAINER
       ========================================================================== */
    .app-main {
      flex: 1;
      position: relative;
    }

    .view-section {
      display: none;
      animation: fadeIn 0.25s ease forwards;
    }

    .view-section.active {
      display: block;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* Page Headings */
    .view-header {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .view-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 2.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .view-subtitle {
      color: var(--slate-500);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-top: 0.4rem;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       6. LANDING PAGE VIEW
       ========================================================================== */
    .hero-section {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.25) 0%, transparent 50%),
                  radial-gradient(circle at 20% 80%, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.3) 0%, transparent 50%),
                  var(--navy-950);
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 5rem 0 6rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
      gap: 3.5rem;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .hero-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--indigo-100);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .hero-pill-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--emerald-500);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--emerald-500);
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      line-height: 1.1;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .hero-title-highlight {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a5b4fc, #c084fc, #f472b6);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .hero-desc {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--slate-300);
      margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 580px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .hero-meta-stats {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2rem;
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }

    .meta-stat-item {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .meta-stat-val {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .meta-stat-label {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--slate-400);
    }

    /* CSS Hero Illustration Card Cluster */
    .hero-visual-card {
      position: relative;
      background: rgba(22, 36, 79, 0.65);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 1.75rem;
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }

    .hero-visual-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      padding-bottom: 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .active-pulse-badge {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #6ee7b7;
      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12);
      padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    }

    .bubble-card {
      background: rgba(11, 19, 41, 0.7);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      transition: transform var(--transition-normal);
    }

    .bubble-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.4);
    }

    .bubble-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .bubble-avatar {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #4f46e5;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .bubble-title {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .bubble-sub {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--slate-400);
    }

    .bubble-msg {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--slate-200);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .tag-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      margin-top: 0.6rem;
    }

    .mini-tag {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      color: var(--indigo-100);
    }

    /* Landing Section: How It Works */
    .landing-section {
      padding: 5rem 0;
    }

    .section-intro {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto 3.5rem;
    }

    .section-intro .badge {
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 2.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .section-desc {
      color: var(--slate-600);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .steps-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .step-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      position: relative;
      transition: all var(--transition-normal);
    }

    .step-card:hover {
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: var(--indigo-100);
    }

    .step-number {
      position: absolute;
      top: 1.5rem;
      right: 1.5rem;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--slate-100);
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .step-icon-box {
      width: 54px;
      height: 54px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      background: var(--indigo-50);
      color: var(--indigo-600);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .step-title {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .step-text {
      color: var(--slate-600);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* Benefits Grid */
    .benefits-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .benefit-item {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 1.75rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
    }

    .benefit-icon {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background: var(--violet-50);
      color: var(--violet-600);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .benefit-info h4 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .benefit-info p {
      font-size: 0.925rem;
      color: var(--slate-600);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* Guidelines / Safety Banner */
    .guidelines-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy-900), var(--navy-800));
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 3rem;
      color: var(--white);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-top: 4rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }

    .guidelines-box h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .guidelines-list {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .guideline-item {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }

    .guideline-item h5 {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--indigo-100);
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .guideline-item p {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--slate-300);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       7. INTERACTIVE DASHBOARD VIEW
       ========================================================================== */
    .dashboard-container {
      padding: 2.5rem 0 4rem;
    }

    .welcome-banner {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy-900), var(--indigo-700));
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 2.25rem;
      color: var(--white);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .welcome-text h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .welcome-text p {
      color: var(--indigo-100);
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .welcome-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* Stat Cards */
    .stats-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
    }

    .stat-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .stat-card-info .stat-num {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .stat-card-info .stat-lbl {
      font-size: 0.825rem;
      color: var(--slate-500);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }

    .stat-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .stat-icon.indigo { background: var(--indigo-50); color: var(--indigo-600); }
    .stat-icon.violet { background: var(--violet-50); color: var(--violet-600); }
    .stat-icon.emerald { background: var(--emerald-50); color: var(--emerald-500); }
    .stat-icon.amber { background: var(--amber-100); color: var(--amber-500); }

    /* Dashboard Layout Grid */
    .dashboard-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.8fr 1.2fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .dash-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .dash-card-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--slate-100);
    }

    .dash-card-title {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    /* Joined Communities Mini List */
    .joined-communities-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .joined-mini-card {
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 1rem;
      background: var(--slate-50);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      transition: all var(--transition-fast);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .joined-mini-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--indigo-400);
      background: var(--white);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    .joined-mini-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .mini-icon {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    .joined-mini-name {
      font-size: 0.925rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
    }

    .joined-mini-desc {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--slate-500);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    /* Discussion Item */
    .discussion-feed-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .dash-discussion-item {
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      background: var(--slate-50);
      transition: all var(--transition-fast);
    }

    .dash-discussion-item:hover {
      background: var(--white);
      border-color: var(--slate-300);
    }

    .discussion-item-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .discussion-meta-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .discussion-author {
      font-size: 0.825rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--navy-900);
    }

    .discussion-time {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--slate-400);
    }

    .discussion-item-title {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--navy-900);
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .discussion-item-snippet {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--slate-600);
      line-height: 1.4;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .discussion-item-footer {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--slate-500);
    }

    /* Recommended Communities */
    .rec-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0.85rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--slate-100);
    }

    .rec-item:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .rec-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .rec-icon {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      background: var(--indigo-50);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .rec-title {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
    }

    .rec-sub {
      font-size: 0.775rem;
      color: var(--slate-500);
    }

    /* Discover Interests Tag Cloud */
    .interest-tag-cloud {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .interactive-tag {
      padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: 0.825rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: var(--slate-100);
      color: var(--slate-700);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      transition: all var(--transition-fast);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .interactive-tag:hover,
    .interactive-tag.selected {
      background: var(--indigo-600);
      color: var(--white);
      border-color: var(--indigo-600);
      transform: scale(1.03);
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       8. COMMUNITIES DIRECTORY & DETAILS VIEW
       ========================================================================== */
    .communities-container {
      padding: 2.5rem 0 4rem;
    }

    /* Filter Toolbar */
    .toolbar-bar {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .search-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 260px;
    }

    .search-input {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.65rem 1rem 0.65rem 2.6rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--slate-200);
      background: var(--slate-50);
      color: var(--slate-800);
      transition: all var(--transition-fast);
    }

    .search-input:focus {
      background: var(--white);
      border-color: var(--indigo-500);
    }

    .search-icon {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0.85rem;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      color: var(--slate-400);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .filter-pills {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .filter-pill {
      padding: 0.45rem 0.85rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: 0.825rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: var(--slate-100);
      color: var(--slate-600);
      transition: all var(--transition-fast);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .filter-pill:hover {
      background: var(--slate-200);
      color: var(--navy-900);
    }

    .filter-pill.active {
      background: var(--navy-900);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    /* Communities Grid */
    .communities-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(340px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.75rem;
    }

    .community-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      padding: 1.75rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      transition: all var(--transition-normal);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .community-card:hover {
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
      border-color: var(--indigo-200);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }

    .community-card-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .community-card-icon {
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--indigo-50), var(--violet-50));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
    }

    .community-card-name {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .community-card-desc {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--slate-600);
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .community-card-tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.35rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .community-card-footer {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding-top: 1rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--slate-100);
    }

    .community-card-members {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--slate-500);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.35rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* Community Detail Page View */
    .community-detail-container {
      padding: 2rem 0 4rem;
    }

    .breadcrumb-bar {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .btn-back {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--slate-600);
      padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
    }

    .btn-back:hover {
      color: var(--indigo-600);
      border-color: var(--indigo-300);
    }

    .community-hero-banner {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy-950), var(--navy-850));
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 2.25rem 2.5rem;
      color: var(--white);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }

    .community-hero-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .community-hero-icon {
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--indigo-600), var(--violet-600));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 2.25rem;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.4);
    }

    .community-hero-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .community-hero-sub {
      color: var(--indigo-100);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .community-detail-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    /* Message Composer */
    .composer-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    }

    .composer-title {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .composer-textarea {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 85px;
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--slate-200);
      background: var(--slate-50);
      color: var(--slate-800);
      resize: vertical;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      transition: all var(--transition-fast);
    }

    .composer-textarea:focus {
      background: var(--white);
      border-color: var(--indigo-500);
    }

    .composer-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .composer-hint {
      font-size: 0.785rem;
      color: var(--slate-500);
    }

    /* Community Feed Messages */
    .feed-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    .feed-header {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--slate-100);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .feed-message-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .feed-message-item {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--slate-100);
    }

    .feed-message-item:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }

    .feed-message-content {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .feed-author-line {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .feed-author-name {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.925rem;
      color: var(--navy-900);
    }

    .feed-author-role {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      background: var(--slate-100);
      padding: 0.1rem 0.45rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      color: var(--slate-600);
    }

    .feed-time {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--slate-400);
      margin-left: auto;
    }

    .feed-text {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      color: var(--slate-700);
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }

    .feed-msg-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .btn-heart-reaction {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.35rem;
      font-size: 0.775rem;
      color: var(--slate-500);
      background: var(--slate-100);
      padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    }

    .btn-heart-reaction:hover,
    .btn-heart-reaction.liked {
      background: var(--rose-100);
      color: var(--rose-500);
    }

    /* Community Detail Sidebar */
    .sidebar-widget {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    }

    .widget-title {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--slate-100);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .guidelines-checklist {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .guideline-check-item {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--slate-600);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .guideline-check-icon {
      color: var(--emerald-500);
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .members-mini-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .member-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .member-info-name {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--navy-900);
    }

    .member-info-role {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--slate-400);
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       9. DOUBT SOLVING (Q&A) VIEW
       ========================================================================== */
    .doubts-container {
      padding: 2.5rem 0 4rem;
    }

    .doubts-action-bar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .doubt-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      padding: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      transition: all var(--transition-normal);
    }

    .doubt-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--indigo-200);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }

    .doubt-card-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .doubt-question-title {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .doubt-body-text {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--slate-700);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      white-space: pre-line;
    }

    .doubt-tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .doubt-footer {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding-top: 1rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--slate-100);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .doubt-author-meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      font-size: 0.825rem;
      color: var(--slate-500);
    }

    .doubt-actions-cluster {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .btn-toggle-answers {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--indigo-600);
      background: var(--indigo-50);
      padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    }

    .btn-toggle-answers:hover {
      background: var(--indigo-100);
    }

    /* Expandable Answers Section */
    .answers-container {
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
      padding-top: 1.25rem;
      border-top: 1.5px dashed var(--slate-200);
      display: none;
    }

    .answers-container.open {
      display: block;
      animation: fadeIn 0.2s ease forwards;
    }

    .answer-item {
      background: var(--slate-50);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .answer-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }

    .answer-author {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--navy-900);
    }

    .answer-text {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      color: var(--slate-700);
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      white-space: pre-line;
    }

    .btn-helpful {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.35rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-300);
      color: var(--slate-600);
      transition: all var(--transition-fast);
    }

    .btn-helpful:hover,
    .btn-helpful.voted {
      background: var(--emerald-50);
      color: var(--emerald-500);
      border-color: var(--emerald-500);
    }

    .write-answer-box {
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
      background: var(--slate-50);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 1rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       10. CAMPUS ACTIVITIES VIEW
       ========================================================================== */
    .activities-container {
      padding: 2.5rem 0 4rem;
    }

    .activities-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(350px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.75rem;
    }

    .activity-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      padding: 1.75rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      transition: all var(--transition-normal);
      position: relative;
    }

    .activity-card:hover {
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
      border-color: var(--indigo-200);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }

    .activity-date-badge {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--indigo-600);
      background: var(--indigo-50);
      padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      align-self: flex-start;
    }

    .activity-card-title {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .activity-location {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--slate-500);
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    }

    .activity-desc {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--slate-600);
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .activity-card-footer {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding-top: 1rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--slate-100);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .attendees-pill {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--slate-500);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.35rem;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       11. STUDENT PROFILES VIEW
       ========================================================================== */
    .profile-container {
      padding: 2.5rem 0 4rem;
    }

    .profile-layout-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .my-profile-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      padding: 2rem;
      position: sticky;
      top: 90px;
    }

    .profile-avatar-large {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ec4899, #8b5cf6);
      color: var(--white);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .profile-user-name {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
    }

    .profile-user-headline {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--indigo-600);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .profile-user-bio {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      color: var(--slate-600);
      line-height: 1.55;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      background: var(--slate-50);
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
    }

    .profile-info-block {
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .profile-block-label {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--slate-400);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .chips-cluster {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .profile-disclaimer-box {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      padding: 0.85rem;
      background: var(--indigo-50);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--indigo-100);
      font-size: 0.775rem;
      color: var(--indigo-700);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    /* Peer Student Directory */
    .peers-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      padding: 1.75rem;
    }

    .peer-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 1.25rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--slate-100);
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .peer-item:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .peer-details-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .peer-avatar {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--indigo-500), var(--violet-500));
      color: var(--white);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .peer-name {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
    }

    .peer-sub {
      font-size: 0.825rem;
      color: var(--slate-500);
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    }

    .peer-tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.3rem;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       12. MODAL DIALOGS
       ========================================================================== */
    .modal-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
      background: rgba(7, 13, 24, 0.7);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity var(--transition-normal);
    }

    .modal-overlay.open {
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .modal-box {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 580px;
      max-height: 90vh;
      overflow-y: auto;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      transform: scale(0.96) translateY(8px);
      transition: transform var(--transition-spring);
    }

    .modal-overlay.open .modal-box {
      transform: scale(1) translateY(0);
    }

    .modal-header {
      padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--slate-100);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .modal-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
    }

    .btn-modal-close {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      color: var(--slate-400);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .btn-modal-close:hover {
      background: var(--slate-100);
      color: var(--slate-800);
    }

    .modal-body {
      padding: 1.75rem;
    }

    .modal-footer {
      padding: 1.25rem 1.75rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--slate-100);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      background: var(--slate-50);
      border-bottom-left-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      border-bottom-right-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    }

    /* Form Fields */
    .form-group {
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .form-label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--navy-900);
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .form-input, .form-select, .form-textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--slate-200);
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--slate-800);
      transition: all var(--transition-fast);
    }

    .form-input:focus, .form-select:focus, .form-textarea:focus {
      border-color: var(--indigo-500);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
    }

    .form-help {
      font-size: 0.775rem;
      color: var(--slate-400);
      margin-top: 0.35rem;
    }

    .form-error {
      font-size: 0.775rem;
      color: var(--rose-500);
      margin-top: 0.35rem;
      display: none;
    }

    .form-error.visible {
      display: block;
    }

    /* Interactive Interest Toggle Pills in Modal */
    .interest-pill-select {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    .interest-selectable-chip {
      padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: var(--slate-100);
      border: 1px solid var(--slate-200);
      color: var(--slate-600);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all var(--transition-fast);
      user-select: none;
    }

    .interest-selectable-chip:hover {
      background: var(--slate-200);
    }

    .interest-selectable-chip.active {
      background: var(--indigo-600);
      color: var(--white);
      border-color: var(--indigo-600);
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       13. TOAST NOTIFICATIONS
       ========================================================================== */
    .toast-container {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 1.5rem;
      right: 1.5rem;
      z-index: 2000;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .toast {
      pointer-events: auto;
      background: var(--navy-900);
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      min-width: 280px;
      max-width: 380px;
      animation: slideToast 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards;
    }

    @keyframes slideToast {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px) scale(0.95); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
    }

    .toast.toast-success { border-left: 4px solid var(--emerald-500); }
    .toast.toast-info { border-left: 4px solid var(--indigo-400); }
    .toast.toast-warning { border-left: 4px solid var(--amber-500); }

    /* ==========================================================================
       14. FOOTER
       ========================================================================== */
    .site-footer {
      background: var(--navy-950);
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 4.5rem 0 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      margin-top: auto;
    }

    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    }

    .footer-brand p {
      color: var(--slate-400);
      font-size: 0.925rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
      max-width: 320px;
    }

    .footer-col h5 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--white);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.65rem;
    }

    .footer-links a,
    .footer-links button {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--slate-400);
      transition: color var(--transition-fast);
      text-align: left;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover,
    .footer-links button:hover {
      color: var(--indigo-300);
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding-top: 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      font-size: 0.825rem;
      color: var(--slate-500);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    /* Empty state */
    .empty-state {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem;
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      border: 1.5px dashed var(--slate-200);
      margin: 1rem 0;
    }

    .empty-icon {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    .empty-title {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy-900);
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    }

    .empty-text {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--slate-500);
      max-width: 400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* ==========================================================================
       15. RESPONSIVE MEDIA QUERIES
       ========================================================================== */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .hero-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 2.5rem;
      }
      .hero-title {
        font-size: 2.85rem;
      }
      .dashboard-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .profile-layout-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .my-profile-card {
        position: static;
      }
      .steps-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .guidelines-list {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .footer-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }
      .community-detail-layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .stats-row {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .nav-menu, .header-actions .btn-profile-badge {
        display: none;
      }
      .mobile-nav-toggle {
        display: flex;
      }
      .hero-title {
        font-size: 2.25rem;
      }
      .benefits-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .joined-communities-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .stats-row {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .welcome-banner {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 1.25rem;
      }
      .community-hero-banner {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 1.25rem;
      }
      .footer-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 2rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ========================================================================
       TOP NAVIGATION BAR
       ======================================================================== -->
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a href="#landing" class="brand-logo" onclick="app.navigate('landing')">
        <div class="brand-icon-wrapper">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
            <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path>
            <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span>Campus<span style="color: var(--indigo-400);">Connect</span></span>
      </a>

      <!-- Desktop Nav Menu -->
      <nav class="nav-menu" aria-label="Main Navigation">
        <button class="nav-link active" data-view="landing" onclick="app.navigate('landing')">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline></svg>
          Home
        </button>
        <button class="nav-link" data-view="dashboard" onclick="app.navigate('dashboard')">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="7" height="9" x="3" y="3" rx="1"></rect><rect width="7" height="5" x="14" y="3" rx="1"></rect><rect width="7" height="9" x="14" y="12" rx="1"></rect><rect width="7" height="5" x="3" y="16" rx="1"></rect></svg>
          Dashboard
        </button>
        <button class="nav-link" data-view="communities" onclick="app.navigate('communities')">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 21a8 8 0 0 0-16 0"></path><circle cx="10" cy="8" r="5"></circle><path d="M22 20c0-3.37-2-6.5-4-8a5 5 0 0 0-.45-8.3"></path></svg>
          Communities
        </button>
        <button class="nav-link" data-view="doubts" onclick="app.navigate('doubts')">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"></line></svg>
          Doubt Solving
        </button>
        <button class="nav-link" data-view="activities" onclick="app.navigate('activities')">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line></svg>
          Activities
        </button>
      </nav>

      <!-- Desktop User Profile Button -->
      <div class="header-actions">
        <button class="btn-profile-badge" onclick="app.navigate('profile')">
          <div class="avatar-sm" id="navAvatarInitials">AR</div>
          <span id="navUserName">Alex Rivera</span>
        </button>

        <!-- Mobile Drawer Toggle -->
        <button class="mobile-nav-toggle" aria-label="Open mobile menu" onclick="app.toggleMobileMenu(true)">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="12" y2="12"></line><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Mobile Drawer -->
  <div class="mobile-drawer" id="mobileDrawer" onclick="if(event.target === this) app.toggleMobileMenu(false)">
    <div class="mobile-drawer-content">
      <div class="drawer-header">
        <div class="brand-logo">
          <div class="brand-icon-wrapper" style="width:34px;height:34px;">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span style="font-size:1.1rem;">Campus Connect</span>
        </div>
        <button class="btn-modal-close" onclick="app.toggleMobileMenu(false)">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="drawer-nav-list">
        <button class="nav-link" data-view="landing" onclick="app.navigate('landing'); app.toggleMobileMenu(false)">Home</button>
        <button class="nav-link" data-view="dashboard" onclick="app.navigate('dashboard'); app.toggleMobileMenu(false)">Dashboard</button>
        <button class="nav-link" data-view="communities" onclick="app.navigate('communities'); app.toggleMobileMenu(false)">Communities</button>
        <button class="nav-link" data-view="doubts" onclick="app.navigate('doubts'); app.toggleMobileMenu(false)">Doubt Solving</button>
        <button class="nav-link" data-view="activities" onclick="app.navigate('activities'); app.toggleMobileMenu(false)">Activities</button>
        <button class="nav-link" data-view="profile" onclick="app.navigate('profile'); app.toggleMobileMenu(false)">My Profile</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ========================================================================
       MAIN VIEWS CONTAINER
       ======================================================================== -->
  <main class="app-main">

    <!-- ======================================================================
         VIEW 1: LANDING PAGE
         ====================================================================== -->
    <section id="view-landing" class="view-section active">
      <!-- Hero Section -->
      <div class="hero-section">
        <div class="container hero-grid">
          <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="hero-pill">
              <span class="hero-pill-dot"></span>
              <span>Your People. Your Interests. Your Campus.</span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="hero-title">
              Find your circle, <br>
              <span class="hero-title-highlight">collaborate freely</span> & thrive together.
            </h1>
            <p class="hero-desc">
              Campus Connect helps college students discover like-minded friends, join verified interest clubs, clear academic doubts without judgment, and participate in low-pressure campus activities.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="app.navigate('communities')">
                <span>Explore Communities</span>
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
              </button>
              <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="app.scrollToSection('how-it-works')">
                <span>See How It Works</span>
              </button>
              <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="app.navigate('dashboard')">
                <span>Open Dashboard</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-meta-stats">
              <div class="meta-stat-item">
                <span class="meta-stat-val">10+</span>
                <span class="meta-stat-label">Active Communities</span>
              </div>
              <div class="meta-stat-item">
                <span class="meta-stat-val">2,400+</span>
                <span class="meta-stat-label">Sample Members</span>
              </div>
              <div class="meta-stat-item">
                <span class="meta-stat-val">100%</span>
                <span class="meta-stat-label">Zero-Pressure Space</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Hero CSS Illustration: Floating Cards & Peer Avatars -->
          <div class="hero-visual">
            <div class="hero-visual-card">
              <div class="hero-visual-header">
                <div style="font-weight:700; font-size: 0.95rem;">Live Campus Pulse</div>
                <div class="active-pulse-badge">
                  <span class="hero-pill-dot" style="background:#10b981;"></span>
                  <span>Active Right Now</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Floating Card 1: Coding -->
              <div class="bubble-card">
                <div class="bubble-top">
                  <div class="bubble-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #06b6d4);">MC</div>
                  <div>
                    <div class="bubble-title">Maya Chen · Coding Community</div>
                    <div class="bubble-sub">20m ago in #dsa-sprint</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p class="bubble-msg">"Hosting a low-stress study session in Library Room 204 for anyone prepping recursive backtracking!"</p>
                <div class="tag-row">
                  <span class="mini-tag">#algorithms</span>
                  <span class="mini-tag">#collaborative</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Floating Card 2: Dance & Music -->
              <div class="bubble-card">
                <div class="bubble-top">
                  <div class="bubble-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f43f5e, #fb923c);">RS</div>
                  <div>
                    <div class="bubble-title">Rahul Sharma · Dance Room</div>
                    <div class="bubble-sub">45m ago in #announcements</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p class="bubble-msg">"Beginners freestyle workshop this Thursday at SAC Studio 2! Absolute newbies welcome!"</p>
                <div class="tag-row">
                  <span class="mini-tag">#dance</span>
                  <span class="mini-tag">#all-levels</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Floating Card 3: Doubt Solving -->
              <div class="bubble-card" style="margin-bottom:0;">
                <div class="bubble-top">
                  <div class="bubble-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #ec4899);">SP</div>
                  <div>
                    <div class="bubble-title">Samira Patel · Doubt Solving</div>
                    <div class="bubble-sub">Just now in #linear-algebra</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p class="bubble-msg">"Can someone explain eigenvalues intuitively using coordinate scaling? Thank you!"</p>
                <div class="tag-row">
                  <span class="mini-tag">#math</span>
                  <span class="mini-tag">#open-doubt</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- How It Works Section -->
      <section id="how-it-works" class="landing-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-intro">
            <span class="badge badge-indigo">Simple & Welcoming</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">How Campus Connect Works</h2>
            <p class="section-desc">Designed deliberately for ease of access and minimal social anxiety. Jump straight into topics you care about.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="steps-grid">
            <div class="step-card">
              <span class="step-number">01</span>
              <div class="step-icon-box">
                <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="step-title">Discover Your Communities</h3>
              <p class="step-text">Explore 10 curated student communities from Coding and Art to Dance, Sports, and Placement Prep. Lurk quietly or join with one click.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="step-card">
              <span class="step-number">02</span>
              <div class="step-icon-box">
                <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="step-title">Ask Doubts & Share Ideas</h3>
              <p class="step-text">Post your toughest coursework questions in our friendly Doubt Solving hub or jump into community conversations without fear of judgment.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="step-card">
              <span class="step-number">03</span>
              <div class="step-icon-box">
                <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="step-title">RSVP to Campus Meetups</h3>
              <p class="step-text">Join photography walks, study sessions, hackathon prep groups, and friendly jam sessions organized directly by fellow students.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Featured Communities Preview -->
      <section class="landing-section" style="background: var(--slate-100);">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-intro">
            <span class="badge badge-violet">Featured Spaces</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Popular Hubs On Campus</h2>
            <p class="section-desc">Get a glimpse of the most vibrant groups welcoming new members today.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="communities-grid" id="landingFeaturedCommunities">
            <!-- Rendered dynamically by JavaScript -->
          </div>

          <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 2.5rem;">
            <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="app.navigate('communities')">
              <span>View All 10 Communities</span>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Benefits Showcase -->
      <section class="landing-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-intro">
            <span class="badge badge-emerald">Community First</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Built For Introverts & Extroverts Alike</h2>
            <p class="section-desc">College is immense. We make finding your close circle comfortable, organic, and friendly.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="benefits-grid">
            <div class="benefit-item">
              <div class="benefit-icon">
                <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="benefit-info">
                <h4>No Awkward Cold Messaging</h4>
                <p>Interact around concrete activities, doubts, and hobbies rather than uncomfortable direct outreach. Shared context removes the awkwardness.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="benefit-item">
              <div class="benefit-icon">
                <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 14 14"></polyline></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="benefit-info">
                <h4>Real-Time Academic Lifeline</h4>
                <p>Stuck on an assignment late at night? Post in Doubt Solving and get peer explanations from classmates who took the class previously.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="benefit-item">
              <div class="benefit-icon">
                <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="benefit-info">
                <h4>Verified College Focus</h4>
                <p>Clean, clutter-free campus environment dedicated exclusively to student growth, collaboration, and healthy extracurriculars.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="benefit-item">
              <div class="benefit-icon">
                <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="benefit-info">
                <h4>Effortless Project Teaming</h4>
                <p>Find teammates for hackathons, engineering capstones, research papers, and startup prototypes with matching interests.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Guidelines Box -->
          <div class="guidelines-box">
            <span class="badge badge-indigo" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); color: #fff;">Our Safe Campus Pledge</span>
            <h3>Community Guidelines & Privacy</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--slate-300); max-width: 680px; font-size: 0.95rem;">
              Campus Connect thrives on mutual support and psychological safety. All students agree to our core guidelines:
            </p>
            <div class="guidelines-list">
              <div class="guideline-item">
                <h5>🤝 Be Respectful & Kind</h5>
                <p>Empathy is foundational. Harsh criticism, harassment, or elitist attitudes have no place in our study groups or forums.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="guideline-item">
                <h5>🌱 Welcome Beginners Warmly</h5>
                <p>Whether someone is writing their first line of code or trying their first dance move, encourage every step forward.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="guideline-item">
                <h5>🔒 Private & Locally Managed</h5>
                <p>This demo runs completely client-side in your browser. Your edits, joined clubs, and posts stay in your local session.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </section>

    <!-- ======================================================================
         VIEW 2: INTERACTIVE DASHBOARD
         ====================================================================== -->
    <section id="view-dashboard" class="view-section">
      <div class="container dashboard-container">
